From 7a611d4e2f5f1a54bb41d9c79dd61f3f0c57909b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh Klar <josh@klar.sh>
Date: Sun, 22 Mar 2026 21:19:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ui: external selector tool for station/song/artist selection

Add optional `selection_command` config key. When set, selection lists
(stations, and song/artist picking during station creation) are piped to
this command and its first output line is matched back to an entry by
the " N) " prefix, enabling tools like fzf or fuzzel -d. Unset or
failing command falls back to the interactive numeric prompt.

Also route password_command through the same external-command runner,
replacing a bespoke fork/pipe block in main.c.
---
 contrib/config-example |   1 +
 contrib/pianobar.1     |   7 +
 src/main.c             |  49 +-----
 src/settings.c         |   3 +
 src/settings.h         |   1 +
 src/ui.c               | 367 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 src/ui.h               |   2 +
 7 files changed, 317 insertions(+), 113 deletions(-)

